<title>SPAIN: Bank of Spain leaves key rate unchanged.</title>
<headline>Bank of Spain leaves key rate unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain said it left its key money rate unchanged at 6.75 percent at today's regular repurchase tender for central bank certificates.</p>
<p>It allotted 4,574,886 pesetas against 4,590,203 bid.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
